<title>USA: Quality Systems Inc Q4 shr shrinks.</title>
<headline>Quality Systems Inc Q4 shr shrinks.</headline>
<dateline>TUSTIN, Calif. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended March 31</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.04   profit	 $0.13</p>
<p> Net profit		   220   profit	   623</p>
<p> Revs			 6,121		    4,411</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,050		    4,979</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.26   profit	 $0.48</p>
<p> Net loss		   7,475   profit	 2,293</p>
<p> Revs			20,127		   16,732</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,937		    4,788</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1997 full year includes an $8.3 million charge for purchased, in-process research and development. On a pro forma basis, excluding the charge, income from operations would have been $324,000, net income would have been $825,000 and net income per share would have been $0.14.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
